  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women-led sustainable lake-based eco-tourism in Kisumu County in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the preparatory assistance is to support the development of a full-fledged UNIDO Project Document to establish a women-led eco-tourism model in Kisumu County that creates income-generating opportunities for women, to be funded by the Government of Slovenia. The PA will enable UNIDO to: - Validate the technical, institutional and budgetary feasibility of the proposed intervention; - Align the project scope with UNIDO implementation requirements (procurement, safeguards, coordination); - Engage key stakeholders at national and county level; and - Produce a UNIDO-compliant Project Document ready for internal approval and donor submission. The PA responds to an explicit request from the Government of Slovenia for UNIDO#s technical input and project formulation support and builds on advanced discussions with Kisumu County authorities regarding potential in-kind contributions.</narrative>
  </description>
